client
dev tun
proto udp
remote SEU_SERVIDOR_VPN 1194
resolv-retry infinite
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun
<ca>
-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
(cole aqui o certificado CA fornecido pelo administrador da VPN)
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
</ca>
tls-client
remote-cert-tls server
auth-user-pass
comp-lzo
verb 3
reneg-sec 0
